        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The metal head of this <em>+1 striking pick</em> glows faintly, intensifying around the tip. The hilt features a grip wrapped in deep-blue leather and is carved with a hawk's wings.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Mystic Strike</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span></p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your last action was to Cast a non-cantrip Spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You make a melee Strike with the pick that overflows with magical energy. You gain a +1 status bonus to this Strike, and if you hit, you deal an additional @Damage[1d4[persistent,force]] damage.</p>"
